<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">04092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>A boat that left the Gambia with one hundred twenty-eight people aboard was found drifting off Gran Canaria twenty-six days later, with more than eighty dead, an infant among them.</s> <s>This wasn't a capsizing... it was a slow death by drift on the Atlantic route, the deadliest and least watched crossing to Europe, opened up when tighter patrols pushed departures fifteen hundred kilometres west into open ocean.</s> <s>The dead are counted in Spanish waters, but the route they took was made by a European policy choice.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Sudan's civilian anti-war coalition has rejected the African Union's endorsement of a national dialogue convened by General Abdelfattah El Burhan, the army commander who is himself a party to the war.</s> <s>The groups are demanding a ceasefire first, and the exclusion of the men they hold responsible for starting the fighting, because a mediator's recognition is a transferable asset, and lending it to a process one belligerent designed launders his authority rather than testing it.</s> <s>Inclusion isn't a courtesy in peace-making — an agreement signed only by those holding the guns binds nobody else.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Near Dilling, in Sudan's Kordofan region, an airstrike destroyed two trucks carrying UN food aid, cutting rations for five thousand eight hundred people in a besieged area for a month.</s> <s>The trucks flew UN banners and flags, the very marking meant to make them untouchable, and the World Food Programme says this is the eighth aerial attack on its convoys.</s> <s>When the marking stops working, the humanitarian system loses the only protection it has ever had.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel's national security minister Itamar Ben-Gvir has put a timetable on expulsion: two hundred fifty thousand Palestinians removed from Gaza in year one, one point eight six million within seven years.</s> <s>A plan with annual quotas isn't rhetoric, it's an administrative document, and administrative documents need budgets, transit routes and receiving states — and no country has agreed to take anyone.</s> <s>What makes it more than one man's provocation is that a cabinet colleague called expulsion the only solution on the very same day.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Seven months into American strikes on Iran, the Vice President still won't use the word war.</s> <s>Naming matters because it's a legal act: the War Powers Resolution's reporting duty and its sixty-day withdrawal clock only start once hostilities are formally acknowledged, so an unnamed conflict runs without a vote Congress never took.</s> <s>In Sirik this week, five people were killed at a wedding, and Iran's Red Crescent has asked the International Criminal Court to treat it as a war crime.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Pentagon has stretched Gulf deployments to breaking point, keeping fifty thousand troops and nineteen warships in place, with the Eighty-Second Airborne possibly staying through twenty twenty-seven.</s> <s>Nine-month air-defence tours have quietly become year-long ones, and Kuwait, Bahrain and Qatar host the buildup without ever having chosen the war it serves.</s> <s>Funding that runs two years out is the clearest statement anyone has made about how long this is expected to last.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Taiwan's foreign minister has accused Chinese officials of conducting espionage on the floor of the Pacific Islands Forum, the one annual meeting where fourteen small states set policy as a single bloc.</s> <s>Beijing objected to Taipei's attendance in Palau, the summit host, then issued Palau a travel warning last month.</s> <s>What the Pacific stands to lose isn't face — it's a consensus body that can no longer deliver the climate financing and fisheries terms its members joined it for.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Algeria has sent four fighter jets to Niamey, giving Niger's junta a second foreign patron alongside Russia's Africa Corps.</s> <s>The deployment follows a weekend mutiny in which army officers attacked an air base and the airport, killing dozens before the junta survived it.</s> <s>Algeria's own constitution restricts sending forces abroad, which makes this as much a domestic constitutional question in Algiers as a regional one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bolivian police have arrested Peru's most-wanted extortion boss, the head of a group known as the Pulpos, days after his cells were blamed for a kidnapping that dominated Peruvian news.</s> <s>Extortion there isn't a leadership business but a territorial franchise, collecting weekly payments from bus drivers, market traders and school owners street by street, so removing the name at the top leaves every collection route intact.</s> <s>Capture-the-kingpin has a measurable record across Latin America — fragmentation, succession violence, and no fall in revenue.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's foreign minister chose Kyiv, of all places, to defend buying Russian crude, telling his hosts that cutting those purchases won't end the war.</s> <s>Russia supplies roughly a third of India's oil at a discount Western buyers won't take, and Delhi's argument is simply that the barrels would reprice to another buyer rather than stay in the ground.</s> <s>That's the Global South's standing position on sanctions, stated at its most uncomfortable venue — and it explains why the price cap hasn't moved prices.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In the Sea of Marmara, ten crew are missing after two ships collided near Istanbul, the captain and nine Turkish sailors unaccounted for in nine hundred metres of water.</s> <s>The Marmara is the crowded approach to the Bosphorus, one of the tightest shipping straits anywhere, where traffic density and geography leave almost no room to manoeuvre.</s> <s>Search teams have recovered an empty lifeboat and nothing else.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Venezuela's opposition leader María Corina Machado says an unelected government can't sign away the country's future, after interim leader Delcy Rodríguez put sixty-five billion barrels of reserves under contract.</s> <s>The deals, with Chevron, GE Vernova and ENI, project two hundred nine billion dollars over twenty-five years, on terms no Venezuelan voted for.</s> <s>Oil contracts outlive governments, which is precisely why the question of who had standing to sign them won't go away.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nvidia is paying twelve point nine billion dollars for Hugging Face, the platform hosting three million open models for eighteen million developers.</s> <s>One company now owns both the chips that train models and the hub where the open ones are shared, and Nvidia says the hub will stay open to rival hardware.</s> <s>Its three French founders became billionaires overnight — the more lasting change is that open AI's commons now has a landlord.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Daejeon have built a flat lens that changes its focus electrically, with no moving parts at all.</s> <s>Photoacoustic imaging fires a pulsed laser and listens for the ultrasound that absorbing tissue gives back, and it has always traded depth against resolution — a switchable lens breaks that trade.</s> <s>Retinal vascular disease is the leading cause of preventable blindness among people with diabetes, and the barrier has never been the physics but the bulk and cost of the scanner.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A four-year-old French startup in Toulouse, ArcSpace, has raised two million euros to fly an electron-beam welder in orbit.</s> <s>The physics is the whole story: electron-beam welding needs a vacuum, which costs a fortune to manufacture on Earth and is free in space, making metal-joining the one industrial process that gets cheaper up there.</s> <s>Every satellite today has to survive launch as a single rigid object, and if a twelve-kilogram demonstrator works, that constraint lifts, in sha'Allah.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Geobacter bacteria, biologists in London report, can breathe using solid sulfur — a substance that doesn't dissolve, so their enzymes must do the chemistry right at the outer membrane.</s> <s>That reaction governs how sulfide moves through wetlands, sediments and flooded soils across the world.</s> <s>Sulfide is what binds heavy metals in place, which makes this quiet microbial trick part of why contaminated ground stays contained.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Forensic researchers have found commercial spyware on fourteen devices in Serbia since December, including those of a sitting lawmaker, an opposition politician and student protesters.</s> <s>Investigators can prove a phone was infected but not who bought the tool — and that gap between infection and procurement is exactly what export-licensing regimes were written to close.</s> <s>Which vendor supplied it, and which Serbian body paid, remain unanswered.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Documents show US Immigration and Customs Enforcement planning a five-million-dollar national voter database, with the agency itself holding the citizenship-verification layer.</s> <s>Voter rolls are run by states precisely so no federal enforcement body holds one file, and matching is probabilistic against names and dates of birth, so the false positives fall hardest on naturalised citizens with common surnames.</s> <s>A register like that, once assembled, can't be unbuilt.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Four major AI services from rival companies went down in overlapping windows on the same Thursday morning.</s> <s>They compete at the model layer but rent from the same handful of clouds, content networks and routing paths underneath, which means buying a second provider isn't the redundancy customers think they've purchased.</s> <s>Correlated failure is the property that matters in any dependency graph, and it never appears on a single vendor's status page.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Tottenham Hotspur cut its virtualisation licensing bill by more than eighty-five percent after moving its stadium infrastructure off VMware to software from Hewlett Packard Enterprise.</s> <s>A saving that large isn't a discount, it's a measurement of how much rent was being extracted after Broadcom repriced an installed base whose workloads hadn't changed at all.</s> <s>Hospitals, universities and municipalities across Africa, Asia and Europe are paying that same price without the budget to migrate away from it.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>